  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/AkashiiKun/MoreAxolotlVariantsMod-Common/blob/master/img/title.png?raw=true\" alt=\"標誌\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjava.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Made with-JAVA-red?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Java\"></a> <a href=\"LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-ARR-red.svg?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"授權：ARR\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmavm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/zitu8weW?logo=modrinth&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmavm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/game-versions/zitu8weW?logo=modrinth&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mavm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_498797_downloads.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"下載次數\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mavm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/498797.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"版本\"></a></p>\n<p>本模組單純為原版 Minecraft 增添了更多美西螈（它們擁有獨立的 NBT 標籤，編號由 5 至 14）。</p>\n<p>與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/axolotl-bucket-fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Axolotl Bucket Fix v1.1.1+</a> 相容（僅限 Fabric）</p>\n<p>自 1.2.0 版本起需依賴 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mavapi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Axolotl Variants API</a>。</p>\n<p>召喚指令：</p>\n<p>/summon minecraft:axolotl [pos] {Variant:\"mavm:&lt;variantname&gt;\"}</p>\n<p>於 2.0.0+ 版本中：</p>\n<p>/summon minecraft:axolotl [pos] {variant:\"mavm:&lt;variantname&gt;\"}</p>\n<p>幽匿美西螈與螢光美西螈僅能透過繁殖取得！</p>\n<p>1.0.8 更新已調整紋理以符合新版美西螈的貼圖變更。<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AkashiiKun/MoreAxolotlVariantsMod-Common/master/img/new_variants.png\" alt=\"新美西螈紋理！\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AkashiiKun/MoreAxolotlVariantsMod-Common/master/img/new_variants_dark.png\" alt=\"新美西螈紋理！\"></p>\n<p>美西螈列表：</p>\n<p>露西亞、野生型、金色、綠色、幽匿、深色、紅色、螢光美西螈、白色、氰化物。</p>\n<p>於 2.0.0+ 版本中，幽匿與深色已更名為 Sculk 與 Black！</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
